          "IK-114533:L149:span2": {
            "text": "It was further alleged that the appellant was charging a fabulous amount as rent from her sub-tenant Sohan Singh.",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L149:span3": {
            "text": "The appellant in her written statement admitted the tenancy",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L149:span4": {
            "text": "denied sub- letting.",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L149:span5": {
            "text": "She alleged that Sohan Singh was her husband",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L149:span6": {
            "text": "from the time of the lease the business of a Chemist was being run there in the premises by her husband and she also occasionally helped him in the running of the business.",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L150:span7": {
            "text": "Sohan Singh and the appellant were living together as husband and wife and, therefore, there was no question of any sub--letting by the appellant of the premises.",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRIOR_COURT_FINDING",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L150:span8": {
            "text": "That finding was confirmed in appeal by the Rent Control Tribunal, Delhi.",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRIOR_COURT_FINDING",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L169:span9": {
            "text": "The respondent himself in his testimony admitted that he had never himself made any enquiry as to whether Sohan Singh and the appellant are husband and wife or not.",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L170:span10": {
            "text": "Neither any talks regarding sub-letting took place in my presence, nor the rent was paid in my presence,",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L171:span11": {
            "text": "he was shown a typed copy of it and this he accepted as a true copy.",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
          },
          "IK-114533:L171:span12": {
            "text": "The true copy disclosed that the appellant was accepted as the wife of Sohan Singh.",
            "document_id": "114533",
            "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/114533/",
            "semantic_stage": "PRE_TARGET_RECORD",
            "prospective_availability": "RETROSPECTIVELY_RECONSTRUCTED_PRE_TARGET"
